  "when_note": "Saturday, December 19, 5 to 8 PM",
  "cost": "$15 per person, children under 3 free",
  "url": "https://www.buschwildlife.org/events/holiday-hootenanny",
  "tickets": "https://bws.givecloud.co/product/93B2782/holiday-hootenanny",
  "kind": "santa outing food",
  "indoor": false,
  "paras": [
   "Busch Wildlife Sanctuary in Jupiter holds its inaugural Holiday Hootenanny on Saturday, December 19, 2026 from 5 to 8 PM. The sanctuary calls it a festive, after-hours event.",
   "Highlights listed by the sanctuary include a visit from Santa and Mrs. Claus, food trucks and beverages, a dessert station with cider donuts, hot cocoa from The Grove Group, and inflatable yard games from Treasure Coast Party Rental.",
   "Guests can also shop in the welcome center, meet wildlife and hear live music.",
   "Admission is $15 per person, and children under 3 get in free. Money left over after costs supports the care of injured and orphaned wildlife."
  ],
  "tip": "Register through the sanctuary's ticket page before the event.",
